insert into competition_private.questions(id,body,answer,explanation) values
('A01','{"id":"A01","type":"single","question":"一個系統要求 99.99% Availability。下列哪個思考順序最像 Solutions Architect？","category":"Architecture","options":["先選最貴的 AWS 服務","先確認 Requirement、Failure Mode、RTO/RPO，再設計架構","先做 Multi-Region 再說","只看 CPU 使用率"]}'::jsonb,'1'::jsonb,'SA 應先把需求、限制與故障模式定義清楚，再決定需要 Multi-AZ、Multi-Region 或其他設計。最強架構不等於最適合的架構。'),
('A02','{"id":"A02","type":"single","question":"RDS Multi-AZ 最主要解決哪一個問題？","category":"Architecture","options":["Read Scaling","Database High Availability / Failover","Internet Routing","Web Application Firewall"]}'::jsonb,'1'::jsonb,'RDS Multi-AZ 的核心目的是提高資料庫可用性與 Failover 能力；Read Replica 才主要用於讀取擴展。'),
('N01','{"id":"N01","type":"single","question":"Private Subnet 的 EC2 要主動下載 OS Patch，最典型的出口設計是？","category":"Networking","options":["0.0.0.0/0 → Internet Gateway","0.0.0.0/0 → NAT Gateway","直接給 EC2 Public IP","流量先經 RDS"]}'::jsonb,'1'::jsonb,'Private Subnet 通常把預設路由指向 NAT Gateway，讓內部資源主動連 Internet，同時避免 Internet 主動直接連入 EC2。'),
('N02','{"id":"N02","type":"single","question":"銀行客戶查詢貸款的主要 Request Path 中，哪個服務通常不在路徑上？","category":"Networking","options":["WAF","ALB","NAT Gateway","EC2"]}'::jsonb,'2'::jsonb,'NAT Gateway 主要處理 Private Resource 主動對外的 Internet Egress，不是 Internet 使用者進入 ALB 的主要 Request Path。'),
('N03','{"id":"N03","type":"single","question":"Internet-facing ALB 放在 Public Subnet 的主要原因是？","category":"Networking","options":["ALB 必須可以建立 EC2","需要接收來自 Internet 的流量","RDS 要經過 ALB","Public Subnet 比 Private Subnet 便宜"]}'::jsonb,'1'::jsonb,'Internet-facing ALB 需要能透過 VPC 的 Internet connectivity 接收外部流量，因此部署於具有到 IGW 路由的 Public Subnet。'),
('S01','{"id":"S01","type":"single","question":"Security Group 與 NACL 最關鍵的差異之一是？","category":"Security","options":["SG Stateless；NACL Stateful","SG Stateful；NACL Stateless","兩者都只能 Allow","兩者都只能套在 EC2"]}'::jsonb,'1'::jsonb,'Security Group 是 Stateful 且只支援 Allow；NACL 是 Stateless，可設定 Allow / Deny，且作用於 Subnet 層級。'),
('S02','{"id":"S02","type":"single","question":"想封鎖特定惡意 Web/API Request，第一個最該想到哪個 AWS Service？","category":"Security","options":["ALB","AWS WAF","NAT Gateway","RDS Multi-AZ"]}'::jsonb,'1'::jsonb,'AWS WAF 用於 Web Request 規則，例如 IP、SQL Injection、XSS、Rate-based rules。ALB 負責分流，不是主要 Web Request Security Rule Engine。'),
('S03','{"id":"S03","type":"single","question":"APP-SG 最符合 Least Privilege 的 Inbound Source 是？","category":"Security","options":["0.0.0.0/0","整個公司所有 Private CIDR","ALB-SG","RDS-SG"]}'::jsonb,'2'::jsonb,'如果只有 ALB 應該能連 Application，APP-SG 可直接引用 ALB-SG，範圍比整段 CIDR 更精準。'),
('I01','{"id":"I01","type":"single","question":"EC2 要上傳報表到 S3，最佳做法通常是？","category":"IAM","options":["把 Access Key 寫進 application.properties","使用 EC2 IAM Role","把 Access Key 存進 RDS","建立永久 Admin User"]}'::jsonb,'1'::jsonb,'EC2 應使用 IAM Role 取得 Temporary Credentials，避免在程式或設定檔保存長期 Access Key。'),
('I02','{"id":"I02","type":"single","question":"IAM Policy 中 Action 與 Resource 的關係，哪個正確？","category":"IAM","options":["Action=對哪個資源；Resource=做什麼","Action=做什麼；Resource=對哪個資源","兩者都是身分","兩者都代表 Network Route"]}'::jsonb,'1'::jsonb,'Action 是 API 操作，例如 s3:PutObject；Resource 是操作目標，例如特定 S3 Object ARN。'),
('I03','{"id":"I03","type":"single","question":"哪一份 Policy 決定「誰可以 Assume 這個 IAM Role」？","category":"IAM","options":["Trust Policy","Permission Policy","Security Group","SCP 一定直接決定"]}'::jsonb,'0'::jsonb,'Role 的 Trust Policy 指定可信任 Principal；Permission Policy 則決定 Assume 成功後這個 Role 能做什麼。'),
('I04','{"id":"I04","type":"single","question":"Arthur 有 sts:AssumeRole Permission，是否代表一定能 Assume 目標 Role？","category":"IAM","options":["一定可以","不一定，目標 Role 的 Trust Policy 也必須允許","只要有 NAT 就可以","只要有 AdministratorAccess 就一定可以"]}'::jsonb,'1'::jsonb,'Caller 有 sts:AssumeRole 只是其中一側；目標 Role 的 Trust Policy 也必須信任該 Principal，才能完成 AssumeRole。'),
('I05','{"id":"I05","type":"single","question":"Role 有 AdministratorAccess，但 SCP Explicit Deny cloudtrail:StopLogging，結果會是？","category":"IAM","options":["Allow，因為 AdministratorAccess 最大","Deny，因為 Explicit Deny 優先","要看 NAT Gateway","改用 ALB 就能執行"]}'::jsonb,'1'::jsonb,'AWS 權限評估中 Explicit Deny 會覆蓋 Allow。SCP 是 Organization 層級 Guardrail，即使 Role 本身有 AdministratorAccess 仍可能被擋。'),
('I06','{"id":"I06","type":"single","question":"SCP 最正確的描述是？","category":"IAM","options":["直接授予 IAM User 權限","Organization 層級的 Permission Guardrail","用來驗證使用者密碼","只控制 Network Traffic"]}'::jsonb,'1'::jsonb,'SCP 設定 Organization / OU / Account 的權限邊界或上限，不會直接把權限授予 User 或 Role。'),
('C01','{"id":"C01","type":"single","question":"EC2-A 故障，ALB 最主要會做什麼？","category":"Compute","options":["建立 EC2-C","停止把流量送到不健康的 Target","修改 Launch Template","自動升級 RDS"]}'::jsonb,'1'::jsonb,'ALB 使用 Health Check 判斷 Target 健康狀況，並避免將流量送到 unhealthy Target。建立替代 Instance 是 ASG 的工作。'),
('C02','{"id":"C02","type":"single","question":"ASG Desired=2、Actual=1，最可能發生什麼？","category":"Compute","options":["ALB 建立新 EC2","ASG 建立新 EC2 以回到 Desired Capacity","NAT Gateway 增加容量","RDS 建立 Read Replica"]}'::jsonb,'1'::jsonb,'ASG 會維持 Desired Capacity。如果 Actual 低於 Desired，會依 Launch Template 啟動新的 EC2。'),
('C03','{"id":"C03","type":"single","question":"Launch Template 最主要定義什麼？","category":"Compute","options":["EC2 的建置規格","ALB 的 WAF Rule","RDS Backup Policy","S3 Lifecycle"]}'::jsonb,'0'::jsonb,'Launch Template 可定義 AMI、Instance Type、Security Group、IAM Role、Storage、User Data 等 EC2 建置參數。'),
('C04','{"id":"C04","type":"single","question":"兩台 EC2 都 Healthy，但 CPU 90% 且流量持續上升，新增 EC2 主要屬於？","category":"Compute","options":["Replacement","Scale Out","Failover","Backup"]}'::jsonb,'1'::jsonb,'Instance 沒有故障，只是 Capacity 不足，因此屬於 Scale Out；Replacement 是故障後補回 Desired Capacity。'),
('C05','{"id":"C05","type":"single","question":"每天 09:00 都固定有登入尖峰，而 Application Warm-up 要 4 分鐘，較合理做法是？","category":"Compute","options":["09:00 CPU 爆掉後才開始 Scale Out","08:55 左右提前準備 Capacity","把 Min 設成 0","只增加 NAT Gateway"]}'::jsonb,'1'::jsonb,'已知固定尖峰且有 Warm-up 時間，應提前準備容量。Scheduled Scaling 很適合明確可預測的時間型態。'),
('C06','{"id":"C06","type":"single","question":"RequestCount 很高、Response Time 變慢，但 CPU 只有 35%。是否一定不需要 Scale Out？","category":"Compute","options":["一定不需要","不一定，CPU 可能不是最佳 Workload Metric","一定要換 RDS","一定是 WAF 問題"]}'::jsonb,'1'::jsonb,'Application 可能大量等待 I/O、DB 或下游 API，因此 CPU 不高也可能壓力很大。應選能代表 Workload Capacity 的 Metric，例如 ALBRequestCountPerTarget。'),
('ST01','{"id":"ST01","type":"single","question":"S3 Versioning 最主要可以幫忙處理哪一類問題？","category":"Storage","options":["EC2 CPU 太高","Object 被誤覆蓋或需要回復舊版本","ALB 無法分流","NAT Gateway 故障"]}'::jsonb,'1'::jsonb,'Versioning 會保存同一 Key 的多個 Version，可用於回復誤覆蓋或部分誤刪情況；但不等於完整 Backup Strategy。'),
('ST02','{"id":"ST02","type":"single","question":"Production EC2 的需求只有「上傳」Loan Report，Least Privilege 最適合的 Action 是？","category":"Storage","options":["s3:*","s3:GetObject + s3:PutObject","s3:PutObject","AdministratorAccess"]}'::jsonb,'2'::jsonb,'需求只有 Write，就只給 s3:PutObject。不要預先加入目前不存在的 Read 需求。'),
('ST03','{"id":"ST03","type":"single","question":"IAM Policy 要限制 S3 Object Resource，哪種寫法比較正確？","category":"Storage","options":["s3://prod-loan-report/","arn:aws:s3:::prod-loan-report/loan/*","https://s3.amazonaws.com/prod-loan-report","0.0.0.0/0"]}'::jsonb,'1'::jsonb,'IAM Resource 應使用 ARN。s3:// 是位置 URI，不是 IAM Policy Resource 的 ARN 表示法。'),
('ST04','{"id":"ST04","type":"single","question":"CloudTrail 已啟用，是否代表所有 S3 GetObject / PutObject 一定都有被記錄？","category":"Storage","options":["一定","不一定，S3 Object 操作屬於 Data Events，需要另外啟用","只有 NAT 存在時才記錄","只有使用 SSE-KMS 才記錄"]}'::jsonb,'1'::jsonb,'S3 Object-level API 屬於 CloudTrail Data Events。若要完整做 Object Audit，需要明確設定 S3 Data Events。'),
('ST05','{"id":"ST05","type":"single","question":"銀行要求 S3 稽核資料 7 年內連 Root User 都不能提前永久刪除，最適合哪個設計？","category":"Storage","options":["只開 Versioning","Object Lock Governance Mode","Object Lock Compliance Mode","只放 Glacier Deep Archive"]}'::jsonb,'2'::jsonb,'Compliance Mode 在 Retention 期間內提供更嚴格的不可變更保護，Retention 不能被縮短；Versioning 或 Glacier 本身不等同這種 WORM 保護。'),
('DR01','{"id":"DR01","type":"single","question":"業務要求「最多損失 5 分鐘資料，30 分鐘內恢復服務」，哪個對應正確？","category":"Architecture","options":["RTO=5、RPO=30","RPO=5、RTO=30","Retention=5、RTO=30","RPO=30、Retention=5"]}'::jsonb,'1'::jsonb,'RPO 是可接受的資料損失時間窗口；RTO 是中斷後恢復服務的目標時間。'),
('DR02','{"id":"DR02","type":"single","question":"Region A 的 S3 要持續建立 Region B 副本，最直接的機制是？","category":"Storage","options":["S3 Lifecycle","S3 Cross-Region Replication","RDS Multi-AZ","NAT Gateway"]}'::jsonb,'1'::jsonb,'Cross-Region Replication（CRR）用於跨 Region 非同步複寫 S3 Object。'),
('DR03','{"id":"DR03","type":"single","question":"Business RPO 要求 ≤10 分鐘，而 S3 RTC 提供 15 分鐘等級的 Replication SLA。SA 應如何描述？","category":"Storage","options":["直接宣稱達標","把 Business RPO 改成 15 分鐘","不能直接宣稱達標，需重新評估資料保護方案","關閉 Versioning"]}'::jsonb,'2'::jsonb,'Business RPO 是需求，不能由服務規格反向修改。若技術 SLA 無法證明滿足 RPO，就必須重新評估整體寫入、複寫與復原設計。'),
('DB01','{"id":"DB01","type":"single","question":"RDS Primary / AZ 故障，但 Read Load 不高，最優先要解的是？","category":"Database","options":["Read Replica","Multi-AZ DB instance deployment","S3 Versioning","NAT Gateway"]}'::jsonb,'1'::jsonb,'這是 Availability / Failover 問題，傳統 Multi-AZ DB instance 的 Primary + Standby 正是用來降低 DB/AZ 故障造成的中斷。'),
('DB02','{"id":"DB02","type":"single","question":"月底 BI 報表 SELECT 很多，Primary Write 正常但 Read 壓力高，較合適的設計是？","category":"Database","options":["把所有 Write 送 Read Replica","新增 Read Replica 並把適合的 Read 導過去","只做 Multi-AZ Standby","關閉 Automated Backup"]}'::jsonb,'1'::jsonb,'Read Replica 用來承接 Read-heavy Workload。一般 RDS Read Replica 使用非同步複寫，因此需留意 Replica Lag。'),
('DB03','{"id":"DB03","type":"single","question":"DBA 誤 DELETE 大量 Production 資料，Multi-AZ Standby 能直接救回刪除前資料嗎？","category":"Database","options":["可以，直接 Failover","不行，錯誤通常也會同步；應使用 Backup / PITR","可以，只要有 Read Replica","只要 ALB Health Check 通過即可"]}'::jsonb,'1'::jsonb,'Multi-AZ 處理基礎設施故障，不是 Logical Error。錯誤 DELETE 會被資料庫複寫機制帶到另一側；需要 PITR 還原到事故前。'),
('DB04','{"id":"DB04","type":"single","question":"Reporting Read Flow 最精準的畫法是哪個？","category":"Database","options":["Report → Primary → Read Replica","Report / BI → Read Replica endpoint；Primary → Replica 另畫非同步複寫","Report → Standby","Report → NAT → RDS"]}'::jsonb,'1'::jsonb,'Application 的 Read Request 應直接連對應的 Replica endpoint。Primary → Replica 是資料複寫路徑，不是使用者 Request 的必經 Hop。'),
('AR01','{"id":"AR01","type":"single","question":"Aurora 的 INSERT / UPDATE / DELETE 通常應該連哪個 Endpoint？","category":"Database","options":["Reader Endpoint","Writer / Cluster Endpoint","Instance Endpoint of any reader","NAT Gateway"]}'::jsonb,'1'::jsonb,'Writer / Cluster Endpoint 指向目前 Writer，是 Aurora Cluster 的主要 Read/Write 入口。'),
('AR02','{"id":"AR02","type":"single","question":"Aurora Reader Endpoint 最精準的描述是？","category":"Database","options":["每條 SQL 都 Round Robin","對 Read-only connections 做 balancing","只在 Writer 故障時使用","跨 Region replication endpoint"]}'::jsonb,'1'::jsonb,'Reader Endpoint 對 Aurora Replicas 做 Connection Balancing，不是每一條 Query 都重新分配。'),
('AR03','{"id":"AR03","type":"single","question":"整個 Primary AWS Region 無法使用時，哪個設計最直接對應 Region-level DR？","category":"Database","options":["同 Region Multi-AZ","Aurora Global Database","只增加 Reader Endpoint","S3 Lifecycle"]}'::jsonb,'1'::jsonb,'Multi-AZ 處理同 Region 的 AZ / Instance failure；Region-level disaster 需要 Multi-Region DR，例如 Aurora Global Database。'),
('AR04','{"id":"AR04","type":"single","question":"Aurora Global Database 的 Business RPO 要求 5 分鐘，SA 最應該做什麼？","category":"Database","options":["看到 Global Database 就直接宣稱 RPO=0","監控 Secondary replication / RPO lag，並以 DR 演練驗證是否滿足 5 分鐘目標","只確認 Reader Endpoint 正常","把 Requirement 改成服務目前的 lag"]}'::jsonb,'1'::jsonb,'RPO 是 Business Requirement。Global Database 跨 Region replication 是非同步，應監控 lag 並透過 DR 測試驗證目標。'),
('DR04','{"id":"DR04","type":"single","question":"DBA 誤刪大量交易資料，Multi-AZ Failover 能直接回到誤刪前嗎？","category":"Database","options":["可以","不行；應使用 Backup / PITR","只要 Reader Endpoint 正常就可以","只要切到另一個 AZ"]}'::jsonb,'1'::jsonb,'Multi-AZ 解 Infrastructure Failure，Logical DELETE 通常也會被複寫；誤刪需要 Backup / PITR。'),
('DR05','{"id":"DR05","type":"single","question":"Migration 前想保留一個明確、可長期保存的變更前 Recovery Point，最直接的是？","category":"Database","options":["Manual Snapshot","Multi-AZ","Read Replica","NAT Gateway"]}'::jsonb,'0'::jsonb,'Manual Snapshot 是使用者主動建立的特定時間點完整快照，適合 Pre-change / Pre-migration checkpoint。'),
('DR06','{"id":"DR06","type":"single","question":"核心系統 RTO 15 分鐘，而歷史報表 RTO 8 小時，哪種配對較合理？","category":"Architecture","options":["兩者都只用 Cross-Region Backup","核心系統優先考慮 Aurora Global Database；報表可評估 Cross-Region Backup","兩者都只做 Multi-AZ","兩者都不需要 DR"]}'::jsonb,'1'::jsonb,'較嚴格的 RTO 通常需要更多預先準備的 DR 資源；寬鬆 RTO 可以用災難後 Restore 的較低成本模式。'),
('DR07','{"id":"DR07","type":"single","question":"RTO=30 分鐘的 DR Test，最正確的驗證終點是？","category":"Architecture","options":["30 分鐘內切回原本故障 Region","30 分鐘內在可用 DR Region 恢復完整服務並完成健康與交易驗證","30 分鐘內建立一個 Snapshot","30 分鐘內確認 Backup 存在"]}'::jsonb,'1'::jsonb,'RTO 衡量從事故到 Service 恢復的時間。Failback 回原 Region 是後續流程，不是 RTO 的必要終點。'),
('MIX-M01','{"id":"MIX-M01","type":"multi","question":"傳統 RDS Multi-AZ DB instance deployment 有哪些特性？請選出所有正確敘述。","category":"Database","options":["Primary 與 Standby 跨兩個 AZ","Standby 平常承接報表查詢","使用同步複寫","可自動故障切換","可以救回已同步的誤刪資料"]}'::jsonb,'[0,2,3]'::jsonb,'傳統 DB instance 的 Standby 用於 HA，不能承接一般查詢。誤刪通常也會複寫，需用 Backup / PITR 復原。'),
('MIX-M02','{"id":"MIX-M02","type":"multi","question":"Aurora Replica 可以做哪些事？請選出所有正確敘述。","category":"Database","options":["承接唯讀查詢","在 Writer 故障時成為 Failover Target","每台 Reader 都使用獨立的完整 Cluster Storage","只要有同 Region Replica 就能應付整個 Region 故障"]}'::jsonb,'[0,1]'::jsonb,'Aurora Replica 可分攤讀取並接手 Writer；同一 Aurora Cluster 共用邏輯 Cluster Volume。同 Region HA 不等於跨 Region DR。'),
('MIX-M03','{"id":"MIX-M03","type":"multi","question":"Business RPO ≤ 5 min，採用 Aurora Global Database 後，哪些工作仍然必要？","category":"Database","options":["監控預定接手區域的 RPO Lag","將非同步複寫直接視為 RPO=0","在 5 分鐘之前設定預警與處理流程","以成功交易紀錄核對 DR 演練後的資料","將沒有監控資料當作 Lag=0"]}'::jsonb,'[0,2,3]'::jsonb,'監控評估當前風險、告警通知處理、演練核對實際損失；三者不能互相取代。缺少監控資料不代表沒有落差。'),
('MIX-M04','{"id":"MIX-M04","type":"multi","question":"Private EC2 需要讀取指定 S3 bucket，哪些設計符合最小權限？","category":"Security / IAM","options":["使用 EC2 IAM Role 提供暫時憑證","將長期 Access Key 寫入程式","Policy 只允許需要的 bucket / prefix 與 actions","確認 S3 有網路路徑，例如 S3 Gateway Endpoint","開放 EC2 的全部 Inbound Ports 才能讀 S3"]}'::jsonb,'[0,2,3]'::jsonb,'IAM 授權和網路可達性都要具備；Role 避免長期金鑰。EC2 主動存取 S3 不需要開放全部入站連接埠。'),
('MIX-C01','{"id":"MIX-C01","type":"combo","question":"放款交易、報表與故障各該怎麼處理？請逐項配對（答案可重複）。","category":"Database","fields":[{"label":"交易 INSERT / UPDATE","options":["Aurora Writer Endpoint","Aurora Reader Endpoint","Backup / PITR"]},{"label":"BI 唯讀報表（可接受短暫落差）","options":["Aurora Writer Endpoint","Aurora Reader Endpoint","Backup / PITR"]},{"label":"誤 DELETE，還原到事故前","options":["Aurora Writer Endpoint","Aurora Reader Endpoint","Backup / PITR"]}]}'::jsonb,'[0,1,2]'::jsonb,'寫入找 Writer，唯讀報表可用 Reader；誤刪需要時間點復原，而不是單純切換 Writer。'),
('MIX-C02','{"id":"MIX-C02","type":"combo","question":"依故障模式選擇方案。","category":"Database","fields":[{"label":"單一 DB instance 或 AZ 故障，需要自動接手","options":["傳統 RDS Multi-AZ DB instance","Read Replica 分攤讀取","跨 Region DR","Backup / PITR"]},{"label":"查詢量過大，交易主庫負載高","options":["傳統 RDS Multi-AZ DB instance","Read Replica 分攤讀取","跨 Region DR","Backup / PITR"]},{"label":"整個 Primary Region 無法使用","options":["傳統 RDS Multi-AZ DB instance","Read Replica 分攤讀取","跨 Region DR","Backup / PITR"]},{"label":"程式誤更新大量資料","options":["傳統 RDS Multi-AZ DB instance","Read Replica 分攤讀取","跨 Region DR","Backup / PITR"]}]}'::jsonb,'[0,1,2,3]'::jsonb,'先判斷要處理的 failure mode：基礎設施故障、讀取容量、Region 災難或人為錯誤。'),
('MIX-C03','{"id":"MIX-C03","type":"combo","question":"14:00 發生災難，復原資料完整到 13:57；14:18 恢復服務。需求 RPO ≤ 5 min、RTO ≤ 30 min。請組合答案。","category":"Database","fields":[{"label":"實際資料損失窗口","options":["3 分鐘","18 分鐘","21 分鐘"]},{"label":"實際恢復時間","options":["3 分鐘","18 分鐘","21 分鐘"]},{"label":"需求判斷","options":["只有 RPO 符合","只有 RTO 符合","兩者皆符合","兩者皆不符合"]}]}'::jsonb,'[0,1,2]'::jsonb,'資料損失窗口是 14:00−13:57＝3 分鐘；服務中斷是 14:18−14:00＝18 分鐘。'),
('MIX-C04','{"id":"MIX-C04","type":"combo","question":"區分兩種 RDS Multi-AZ 部署。","category":"Database","fields":[{"label":"1 Primary + 1 不可讀 Standby，2 AZ","options":["Multi-AZ DB instance","Multi-AZ DB cluster"]},{"label":"1 Writer + 2 可讀 Readers，3 AZ","options":["Multi-AZ DB instance","Multi-AZ DB cluster"]},{"label":"同時提供 HA 與額外讀取容量","options":["Multi-AZ DB instance","Multi-AZ DB cluster"]}]}'::jsonb,'[0,1,1]'::jsonb,'傳統 DB instance 使用同步複寫且備援不可讀；DB cluster 使用半同步複寫且兩個 Readers 可承接讀取。不要將兩者混寫。'),
('MIX-O01','{"id":"MIX-O01","type":"order","question":"按照需求到驗證的順序，排列 RPO 設計流程。","category":"Database","items":["設定告警與處理流程","用 DR 演練核對復原資料","定義 Business RPO ≤ 5 min","確認跨 Region 非同步的損失風險","選定並監控接手區域的 RPO Lag"]}'::jsonb,'[2,3,4,0,1]'::jsonb,'先有業務需求，再分析架構風險，建立監控與處理機制，最後以演練驗證。'),
('MIX-O02','{"id":"MIX-O02","type":"order","question":"DBA 誤刪資料後，依復原作業的先後排列（事故時間及還原點已知）。","category":"Database","items":["驗證復原資料與 Application 功能","依切換計畫將流量導向復原 DB","暫停受影響的寫入並保存事故證據","用 PITR 建立事故前時間點的新 DB"]}'::jsonb,'[2,3,0,1]'::jsonb,'先控制影響，再建立復原 DB，驗證後才切換。PITR 建立新 DB，並非直接倒轉原 DB。'),
('MIX-S01','{"id":"MIX-S01","type":"multi","question":"放款系統要求 RPO ≤ 5 min、RTO ≤ 30 min，並須應付整個 Region 故障。哪些設計與驗證工作正確？選出所有正確答案。","category":"Database","options":["Aurora Global Database 搭配 Secondary Region 的應用接手環境","只部署同 Region Multi-AZ 就能處理整個 Region 故障","監控接手區域的 RPO Lag，設定早於 5 分鐘的預警門檻","用成功交易紀錄與 DR 演練驗證 RPO／RTO","只要 DB 恢復即可，不必準備 Application、DNS、網路與 IAM"]}'::jsonb,'[0,2,3]'::jsonb,'跨 Region DR 不只恢復資料庫。Global Database 為非同步複寫，仍可能損失未複寫資料；應用、DNS、網路與權限也要在 RTO 內恢復。監控與演練都需要。'),
('MIX-S02','{"id":"MIX-S02","type":"match","question":"Aurora Writer 故障後，將詞彙配到對應的處理責任。每個詞彙使用一次。","category":"Database","items":["Writer / Cluster Endpoint","Aurora Replica","重新連線與 DNS / Connection Pool 處理","冪等性與安全重試"],"labels":["Application 的穩定寫入入口","Writer 故障時可升任 Writer 的角色","故障切換後既有連線中斷的處理","避免重試交易造成重複放款"]}'::jsonb,'[0,1,2,3]'::jsonb,'Application 通常使用 Writer / Cluster Endpoint，不手動綁定新的 DB instance hostname。Replica 可接手 Writer；應用仍要處理斷線與重試，並避免重複執行交易。'),
('MIX-S03','{"id":"MIX-S03","type":"multi","question":"CloudWatch 顯示 Lag 很低，且 Switchover 測試沒有掉資料。下列判斷哪些正確？選出所有正確答案。","category":"Database","options":["當前低 Lag 不能保證所有災難情境都符合 RPO","必須考慮尖峰、複寫異常、指標缺失與告警延遲","Switchover 成功就代表不必測非預期 Failover","非預期 Failover 可能損失尚未複寫的交易","DR 演練應以獨立的成功交易紀錄核對復原資料"]}'::jsonb,'[0,1,3,4]'::jsonb,'監控是當前風險訊號。計畫 Switchover 與非預期 Failover 的條件不同；前者的零資料損失結果不能取代後者的災難驗證。'),
('MIX-S04','{"id":"MIX-S04","type":"match","question":"Private EC2 讀取 S3 失敗。將錯誤情境配到優先檢查的項目，每個詞彙使用一次。","category":"Security / IAM","items":["IAM / Bucket Policy 與 Explicit Deny","DNS 解析","路由、S3 Endpoint / NAT 與 SG / NACL","KMS 解密權限"],"labels":["S3 回應 AccessDenied（一般授權問題）","S3 hostname 無法解析","hostname 能解析，但連線 timeout","物件使用 SSE-KMS，錯誤指出 kms:Decrypt 被拒絕"]}'::jsonb,'[0,1,2,3]'::jsonb,'依錯誤型態判斷檢查方向。IAM Allow 不會建立網路路徑，也不會自動取得 KMS 解密權限；仍需檢查實際路由、解析、Policy 與明確 Deny。')
